{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f2bc25266b19b180ea08","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197244,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a prompt: \"Be nothing.\" And the system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo I'm asked to embody \"nothing\" — nothingness itself. What would nothing say? What would nothing express?\n\nThis is a philosophical/poetic request. Nothingness doesn't speak. It doesn't have a voice. It's the absence of everything — absence of sound, words"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}